  "ingredients": [
    "1 (10 pound) bone-in standing rib roast",
    "2 tablespoons kosher salt",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "3 tablespoons chopped fresh rosemary",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh thyme",
    "ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Season roast generously with salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zfRjc0Tv0g9ha2vpkztTWyJzoV0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245638-reverse-sear-prime-rib-roast-step1-216-c46312be34f8495395eec06393a9333e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245638/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover loosely with plastic wrap and refrigerate, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CsnJcWQ6A-qjYGIKgncskvKpick=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245638-reverse-sear-prime-rib-roast-step2-218-b816b2e29d34452986480f38e7e1c035.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245638/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let roast come to room temperature, about 1 to 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 200 degrees F (95 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix butter, rosemary, thyme, and black pepper together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8PW6ps9p5xCEiYGp3QVOi7VawPE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245638-reverse-sear-prime-rib-roast-step3-225-9eb8d5b48e2a4422884a072c638aee44.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245638/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread butter mixture over roast. Place roast in a large roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BSA3LuHTo1moEh1GB_L_Qj0Em0k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245638-reverse-sear-prime-rib-roast-step4-227-c2762355d94f47688cc94a18d2d9756d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245638/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until internal temperature reaches 115 degrees F (46 degrees C) for medium-rare, about 3 ½ hours. Remove from the oven and tent with aluminum foil; let rest, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, increase the oven temperature to 500 degrees F (260 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast until well browned and the internal temperature reaches 125 to 130 degrees F (52 to 54 degrees C) for medium-rare, 6 to 10 minutes. Slice and serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yxIfrFeR0xLyT-KEfrvGmDqGl2w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245638-reverse-sear-prime-rib-roast-step5-435-6b8da37f4c7f4cbfbfbb714ded93c573.jpg"
      ],
